            <ArticleTitle>[Treatment of unstable angina].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>286-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Unstable angina generally is a serious condition which often requires hospital treatment. In this review article, we shall describe our therapeutic approach to unstable angina. It is almost identical worldwide. This attitude is based on the evidence provided by well controlled clinical trials. It is therefore a good example of Evidence-Based Medicine.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
